  25:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****   ==============================================================================
  26:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****                       ##### DAC Peripheral features #####
  27:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****   ==============================================================================
  28:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  29:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Channels ***
ARM GAS  /tmp/cczQhqiP.s 			page 2


  30:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       ====================
  31:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  32:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     The device integrates up to 3 12-bit Digital Analog Converters that can
  33:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     be used independently or simultaneously (dual mode):
  34:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) DAC1 channel1 with DAC1_OUT1 (PA4) as output
  35:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) DAC1 channel2 with DAC1_OUT2 (PA5) as output
  36:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****           (for STM32F3 devices having 2 channels on DAC1)
  37:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) DAC2 channel1 with DAC2_OUT1 (PA6) as output
  38:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****           (for STM32F3 devices having 2 DAC)
  39:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  40:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Triggers ***
  41:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       ====================
  42:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  43:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     Digital to Analog conversion can be non-triggered using DAC_TRIGGER_NONE
  44:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     and DAC1_OUT1/DAC1_OUT2/DAC2_OUT1 is available once writing to DHRx register.
  45:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
  46:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     Digital to Analog conversion can be triggered by:
  47:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) External event: EXTI Line 9 (any GPIOx_PIN_9) using DAC_TRIGGER_EXT_IT9.
  48:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****           The used pin (GPIOx_PIN_9) must be configured in input mode.
  49:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  50:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) Timers TRGO: TIM2, TIM4, TIM5, TIM6, TIM7 and TIM8
  51:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****           (DAC_TRIGGER_T2_TRGO, DAC_TRIGGER_T4_TRGO...)
  52:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  53:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (#) Software using DAC_TRIGGER_SOFTWARE
  54:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  55:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** DAC Buffer mode feature ***
  56:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       ===============================
  57:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
  58:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       Each DAC channel integrates an output buffer that can be used to
  59:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       reduce the output impedance, and to drive external loads directly
  60:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       without having to add an external operational amplifier.
  61:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       To enable, the output buffer use
  62:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       sConfig.DAC_OutputBuffer = DAC_OUTPUTBUFFER_ENABLE;
  63:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       Or
  64:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       An output switch
  65:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (in STM32F303x4, STM32F303x6, STM32F303x8
  66:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****              c, STM32F334x6, STM32F334x8
  67:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            & STM32F334xx).
  68:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       To enable, the output switch
  69:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       sConfig.DAC_OutputSwitch = DAC_OUTPUTSWITCH_ENABLE;
  70:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
  71:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (@) Refer to the device datasheet for more details about output
  72:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****           impedance value with and without output buffer.
  73:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  74:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       *** GPIO configurations guidelines ***
  75:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       =====================
  76:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       [..]
  77:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       When a DAC channel is used (ex channel1 on PA4) and the other is not
  78:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (ex channel2 on PA5 is configured in Analog and disabled).
  79:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       Channel1 may disturb channel2 as coupling effect.
  80:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       Note that there is no coupling on channel2 as soon as channel2 is turned on.
  81:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       Coupling on adjacent channel could be avoided as follows:
  82:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       when unused PA5 is configured as INPUT PULL-UP or DOWN.
  83:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       PA5 is configured in ANALOG just before it is turned on.
  84:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  85:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  86:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC wave generation feature ***
ARM GAS  /tmp/cczQhqiP.s 			page 3


  87:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        ===================================
  88:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
  89:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        Both DAC channels of DAC1 can be used to generate
  90:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        note that wave generation is not available in DAC2.
  91:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) Noise wave
  92:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) Triangle wave
  93:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  94:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        Wave generation is NOT available in DAC2.
  95:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
  96:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC data format ***
  97:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        =======================
  98:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
  99:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        The DAC data format can be:
 100:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 8-bit right alignment using DAC_ALIGN_8B_R
 101:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 12-bit left alignment using DAC_ALIGN_12B_L
 102:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) 12-bit right alignment using DAC_ALIGN_12B_R
 103:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 104:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DAC data value to voltage correspondence ***
 105:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        ================================================
 106:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 107:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        The analog output voltage on each DAC channel pin is determined
 108:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        by the following equation:
 109:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 110:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        DAC_OUTx = VREF+ * DOR / 4095
 111:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) with  DOR is the Data Output Register
 112:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 113:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****           VEF+ is the input voltage reference (refer to the device datasheet)
 114:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 115:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****         e.g. To set DAC_OUT1 to 0.7V, use
 116:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+)  Assuming that VREF+ = 3.3V, DAC_OUT1 = (3.3U * 868U) / 4095U = 0.7V
 117:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 118:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        *** DMA requests  ***
 119:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        =====================
 120:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 121:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        A DMA1 or DMA2 request can be generated when an external trigger
 122:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (but not a software trigger) occurs if DMA1 or DMA2 requests are
 123:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        enabled using HAL_DAC_Start_DMA().
 124:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        [..]
 125:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        DMA1 requests are mapped as following:
 126:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) DAC1 channel1: mapped either on
 127:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (++) DMA1 channel3
 128:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (++) or DMA2 channel3 (for STM32F3 devices having 2 DMA)
 129:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****              which must be already configured
 130:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) DAC1 channel2:
 131:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****              (for STM32F3 devices having 2 channels on DAC1)
 132:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****              mapped either on
 133:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (++) DMA1 channel4
 134:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (++) or DMA2 channel4 (for STM32F3 devices having 2 DMA)
 135:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****              which must be already configured
 136:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 137:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (#) DAC2 channel1: mapped either on
 138:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****              (for STM32F3 devices having 2 DAC)
 139:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (++) DMA1 channel4
 140:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****          (++) or DMA2 channel4 (for STM32F3 devices having 2 DMA)
 141:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****              which must be already configured
 142:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 143:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
ARM GAS  /tmp/cczQhqiP.s 			page 4


 144:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (@) For Dual mode and specific signal (Triangle and noise) generation please
 145:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        refer to Extended Features Driver description
 146:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 147:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****                       ##### How to use this driver #####
 148:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****   ==============================================================================
 149:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
 150:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) DAC APB clock must be enabled to get write access to DAC
 151:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****           registers using HAL_DAC_Init()
 152:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Configure DAC_OUTx (DAC_OUT1: PA4, DAC_OUT2: PA5) in analog mode.
 153:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Configure the DAC channel using HAL_DAC_ConfigChannel() function.
 154:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) Enable the DAC channel using HAL_DAC_Start() or HAL_DAC_Start_DMA() functions
 155:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 156:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****      *** Polling mode IO operation ***
 157:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****      =================================
 158:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****      [..]
 159:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Start the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Start()
 160:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) To read the DAC last data output value, use the HAL_DAC_GetValue() function.
 161:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Stop the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Stop()
 162:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 163:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****      *** DMA mode IO operation ***
 164:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****      ==============================
 165:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****      [..]
 166:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Start the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Start_DMA(), at this stage the user specify the l
 167:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            of data to be transferred at each end of conversion
 168:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) At the middle of data transfer HAL_DAC_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_ConvHalfCp
 169:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            function is executed and user can add his own code by customization of function pointer
 170:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh2()
 171:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) At The end of data transfer HAL_DAC_ConvCpltCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_ConvHalfCpltCallb
 172:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            function is executed and user can add his own code by customization of function pointer
 173:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_ConvCpltCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh2()
 174:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) In case of transfer Error, HAL_DAC_ErrorCallbackCh1() function is executed and user can
 175:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****             add his own code by customization of function pointer HAL_DAC_ErrorCallbackCh1
 176:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) In case of DMA underrun, DAC interruption triggers and execute internal function HAL_DAC
 177:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_DMAUnderrunCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_DMAUnderrunCallbackCh2()
 178:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            function is executed and user can add his own code by customization of function pointer
 179:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_DMAUnderrunCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_DMAUnderrunCallbackCh2() and
 180:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****            add his own code by customization of function pointer HAL_DAC_ErrorCallbackCh1()
