 183:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     *** Callback registration ***
 184:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     =============================================
 185:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
 186:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       The compilation define  USE_HAL_DAC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 187:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 188:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 189:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     Use Functions HAL_DAC_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback,
 190:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       it allows to register following callbacks:
 191:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvCpltCallbackCh1     : callback when a half transfer is completed on Ch1.
 192:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1 : callback when a transfer is completed on Ch1.
 193:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ErrorCallbackCh1        : callback when an error occurs on Ch1.
 194:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) DMAUnderrunCallbackCh1  : callback when an underrun error occurs on Ch1.
 195:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvCpltCallbackCh2     : callback when a half transfer is completed on Ch2.
 196:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh2 : callback when a transfer is completed on Ch2.
 197:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ErrorCallbackCh2        : callback when an error occurs on Ch2.
 198:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) DMAUnderrunCallbackCh2  : callback when an underrun error occurs on Ch2.
 199:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) MspInitCallback         : DAC MspInit.
 200:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) MspDeInitCallback       : DAC MspdeInit.
ARM GAS  /tmp/cczQhqiP.s 			page 5


 201:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 202:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       and a pointer to the user callback function.
 203:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 204:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****     Use function HAL_DAC_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 205:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       weak (overridden) function. It allows to reset following callbacks:
 206:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvCpltCallbackCh1     : callback when a half transfer is completed on Ch1.
 207:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1 : callback when a transfer is completed on Ch1.
 208:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ErrorCallbackCh1        : callback when an error occurs on Ch1.
 209:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) DMAUnderrunCallbackCh1  : callback when an underrun error occurs on Ch1.
 210:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvCpltCallbackCh2     : callback when a half transfer is completed on Ch2.
 211:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh2 : callback when a transfer is completed on Ch2.
 212:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ErrorCallbackCh2        : callback when an error occurs on Ch2.
 213:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) DMAUnderrunCallbackCh2  : callback when an underrun error occurs on Ch2.
 214:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) MspInitCallback         : DAC MspInit.
 215:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) MspDeInitCallback       : DAC MspdeInit.
 216:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) All Callbacks
 217:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       This function) takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle and the Callback ID.
 218:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 219:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       By default, after the HAL_DAC_Init and if the state is HAL_DAC_STATE_RESET
 220:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       all callbacks are reset to the corresponding legacy weak (overridden) functions.
 221:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit callbacks that are respectively
 222:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       reset to the legacy weak (overridden) functions in the HAL_DAC_Init
 223:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       and  HAL_DAC_DeInit only when these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 224:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       If not, MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_DAC_Init and HAL_DAC_DeInit
 225:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand)
 226:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 227:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in READY state only.
 228:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       Exception done for MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks that can be registered/unregistered
 229:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       in READY or RESET state, thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used
 230:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       during the Init/DeInit.
 231:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 232:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       using HAL_DAC_RegisterCallback before calling HAL_DAC_DeInit
 233:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       or HAL_DAC_Init function.
 234:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 235:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       When The compilation define USE_HAL_DAC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 236:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       not defined, the callback registering feature is not available
 237:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c ****       and weak (overridden) callbacks are used.
 238:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dac.c **** 
